# Implementation Plan: MapTiler Integration for Climate Change Dashboard

Add an interactive MapTiler map to the climate change dashboard. This map will show all 55 meteorological weather stations as markers. Selecting a station or loading the dashboard will zoom the map to its location, and clicking a marker on the map will select that station in the dashboard.

